{"seq":3,"slug":"creator-tier-fraud-signal","title":"达人分层与水军/刷量信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-influencer-kol-marketing-platform/creator-discovery-profile/creator-tier-fraud-signal","wordCount":2409,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"达人分层与水军-刷量信号\">达人分层与水军/刷量信号</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前面两篇的所有计算都建立在一个隐含假设上：平台给出的数字是真的。这个假设经常不成立。粉丝可以按千计价购买，互赞可以进群互换，评论可以用脚本批量灌水，直播观众可以是挂机号。据估计，社交平台的虚假账号占比在部分平台可达两位数百分比，而「假粉丝」直接把创作者报价推高——品牌为不可见的人付费。达人分层与反刷量要做的，就是在花钱之前把这些污染识别出来。</p>\n<p>这一篇有两个交付物，它们服务不同目的。</p>\n<p><strong>分层（tiering）</strong> 是把达人按规模与影响力划档，目的是<strong>匹配预算与产出预期</strong>。它是中性分类，不涉及好坏判断。</p>\n<p><strong>风险评分（risk scoring）</strong> 是对数据真实性给出一个可分级的判断，目的是<strong>过滤与降权</strong>。它是负面信号，命中即影响合作决策。</p>\n<p>两者必须分开建模：一个百万粉的头部达人可能是高分层同时低风险，一个十万粉的达人可能是中分层但高风险。把两者压成一个「综合分」会导致无法解释——运营无法回答「这个人为什么被拒」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[达人指标快照] --&gt; B[规模与互动指标]&#10;  A --&gt; C[时间序列特征]&#10;  A --&gt; D[受众质量特征]&#10;  B --&gt; E[分层: 头/腰/尾/纳米]&#10;  C --&gt; F[异常检测]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[风险分 0-100]&#10;  G --&gt; H{风险档位}&#10;  H --&gt;|低| I[进入邀约队列]&#10;  H --&gt;|中| J[人工复核]&#10;  H --&gt;|高| K[加入黑名单]&#10;  E --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[达人指标快照] --&gt; B[规模与互动指标]\n  A --&gt; C[时间序列特征]\n  A --&gt; D[受众质量特征]\n  B --&gt; E[分层: 头/腰/尾/纳米]\n  C --&gt; F[异常检测]\n  D --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[风险分 0-100]\n  G --&gt; H{风险档位}\n  H --&gt;|低| I[进入邀约队列]\n  H --&gt;|中| J[人工复核]\n  H --&gt;|高| K[加入黑名单]\n  E --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"达人分层的维度与阈值\">达人分层的维度与阈值</h2><h3 id=\"为什么单看粉丝数不够\">为什么单看粉丝数不够</h3><p>粉丝数是最粗的分层依据，因为它跨平台不可比（第 1 篇已说明 YouTube 订阅数四舍五入到三位有效数字），而且与真实产出相关性弱。较完整的分层用三个维度的组合：规模（粉丝/订阅量级）、活跃度（发布频率与近期趋势）、互动质量（互动率而非互动绝对量）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>典型粉丝量级</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>合作定位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>头部 / Mega</td>\n<td>≥ 100 万</td>\n<td>曝光大、报价高、配合度低</td>\n<td>品牌声量、新品造势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>腰部 / Macro</td>\n<td>10 万 – 100 万</td>\n<td>垂类影响力强、可议价</td>\n<td>主推品、内容主力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微型 / Micro</td>\n<td>1 万 – 10 万</td>\n<td>互动率高、性价比好</td>\n<td>铺量、测品、口碑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纳米 / Nano</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 万</td>\n<td>信任度高、规模有限</td>\n<td>种子铺量、UGC 素材</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分层阈值必须<strong>按平台分别配置</strong>：同样 10 万粉丝，在 TikTok 属于微型，在某个小众垂类平台可能已是头部。硬编码一套全局阈值是常见的架构错误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"互动率必须按平台基线标准化\">互动率必须按平台基线标准化</h3><p>互动率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>likes</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>comments</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>shares</mtext></mrow><mtext>followers</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ER = \\frac{\\text{likes} + \\text{comments} + \\text{shares}}{\\text{followers}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">followers</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">likes</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">comments</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shares</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是最常用的质量指标，但它有两个陷阱。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>它随粉丝量级递减</strong>。百万粉账号的 ER 常低于 1%，而万粉账号可达 5% 以上，这不是质量差异而是结构差异（大盘流量摊薄）。因此不能用统一阈值判断，必须按同层级的分布做标准化：把达人 ER 转成同层级内的百分位。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>它可以用粉丝数注水来操纵</strong>。买入大量僵尸粉会同时抬高分母、压低 ER，反而让账号看起来「不划算」——所以刷量的动机不是单纯加粉，而是加粉后再刷互动，使 ER 保持在看起来正常的区间。这个组合特征正是风险检测要抓的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 同层级标准化：把 ER 转成同平台同层级内的百分位&#10;WITH base AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    account_id,&#10;    platform,&#10;    tier,&#10;    engagement_rate,&#10;    PERCENT_RANK() OVER (&#10;      PARTITION BY platform, tier&#10;      ORDER BY engagement_rate&#10;    ) AS er_pctl&#10;  FROM creator_quality_view&#10;  WHERE snapshot_date = CURRENT_DATE&#10;)&#10;SELECT account_id, platform, tier,&#10;       ROUND(engagement_rate, 4) AS er,&#10;       ROUND(er_pctl, 3)         AS er_percentile&#10;FROM base&#10;WHERE account_id = ?;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 同层级标准化：把 ER 转成同平台同层级内的百分位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    account_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    platform,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    engagement_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    PERCENT_RANK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> platform, tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> engagement_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> er_pctl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> creator_quality_view</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> snapshot_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id, platform, tier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(engagement_rate, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> er,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(er_pctl, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> er_percentile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"刷量信号的检测方法\">刷量信号的检测方法</h2><h3 id=\"信号分类与可观测性\">信号分类与可观测性</h3><p>有效的检测不是寻找单一「决定性证据」，而是组合多个弱信号。按可获取性分三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号类别</th>\n<th>具体指标</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态结构</td>\n<td>粉丝/关注比异常、粉丝地理极度集中</td>\n<td>官方 API + 第三方</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态行为</td>\n<td>涨粉曲线阶梯状、单条内容数据突变</td>\n<td>自采快照</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受众侧</td>\n<td>评论重复度高、评论账号自身为空号</td>\n<td>内容抓取</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨源不一致</td>\n<td>供应商 A 与供应商 B 数据差异大</td>\n<td>多源比对</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「动态行为」类可靠性最高的原因是它依赖<strong>自己持续采集的时间序列</strong>，无法被对方在事后修饰。这也解释了为什么第 1 篇强调快照留存——没有历史快照，这一类信号根本无法计算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"涨粉曲线的阶梯检测\">涨粉曲线的阶梯检测</h3><p>真实的自然涨粉通常是连续的、带噪声的曲线；购买粉丝则表现为某一天或几天内的阶跃。检测方法是看日增量的分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_t = \\frac{\\Delta f_t - \\mu_{\\Delta}}{\\sigma_{\\Delta}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta f_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 天的粉丝增量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是窗口内的均值与标准差。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超过阈值（如 4）且该阶跃后<strong>没有对应的内容爆发</strong>（播放量未同步上升），则是买粉的强信号。关键在最后这个条件：一次病毒式爆款同样会造成粉丝阶跃，但它一定伴随播放量同步上升。只抓阶跃不看播放量会产生大量误报。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 涨粉阶跃检测：阶跃日 + 播放量未同步上升&#10;WITH d AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    creator_id,&#10;    snapshot_date,&#10;    followers - LAG(followers) OVER (&#10;      PARTITION BY creator_id ORDER BY snapshot_date&#10;    ) AS df,&#10;    avg_views,&#10;    avg_views - LAG(avg_views) OVER (&#10;      PARTITION BY creator_id ORDER BY snapshot_date&#10;    ) AS dv&#10;  FROM creator_metric_snapshot&#10;  WHERE source = &#39;official&#39;&#10;    AND snapshot_date &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;60 days&#39;&#10;),&#10;s AS (&#10;  SELECT *,&#10;    AVG(df)    OVER (PARTITION BY creator_id) AS mu_df,&#10;    STDDEV_SAMP(df) OVER (PARTITION BY creator_id) AS sd_df&#10;  FROM d&#10;)&#10;SELECT creator_id, snapshot_date, df, dv,&#10;       ROUND((df - mu_df) / NULLIF(sd_df, 0), 2) AS z_score&#10;FROM s&#10;WHERE sd_df &gt; 0&#10;  AND (df - mu_df) / NULLIF(sd_df, 0) &gt; 4      -- 粉丝阶跃&#10;  AND (dv IS NULL OR dv &lt; 0)                   -- 播放量未同步上升&#10;ORDER BY z_score DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 涨粉阶跃检测：阶跃日 + 播放量未同步上升</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    creator_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    snapshot_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    followers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LAG</span><span s